    "body": "I'm trying to get this client to work for me but the fact that the UserManager expects a standard and fully-baked window object (with XMLHttpRequest), localStorage and sessionStorage (with getItem/removeItem makes it tough to develop Isomorphic react applications.\r\n\r\nIt would be great if the client did not assume/require a browser environment and could take a generic object as its store.",
